{'symbol': 'ROL', 'date': '2021-04-27 16:30:00', 'title': 'ROLLINS, INC. ANNOUNCES REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'ATLANTA, APRIL 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ROLLINS, INC. (NYSE: ROL), A PREMIER GLOBAL CONSUMER AND COMMERCIAL SERVICES\xa0COMPANY ANNOUNCED THAT THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND ON ITS COMMON STOCK OF $0.08 PER SHARE PAYABLE JUNE 10, 2021 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MAY 10, 2021. ROLLINS, INC. IS A PREMIER GLOBAL CONSUMER AND COMMERCIAL SERVICES COMPANY.'}